{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_013_02_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:50865bef2db0194cb85b616d1de5fe00fa40d2dc80fce31c56704942506d3cd2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84fbbe7a9d8eb9c83c72ef662a9c6416431decb444bc7ae404917508dcd258b8",
      "text": "（作为偶像决胜负？试镜？\n果然，完～全听不懂）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b1d569f5fd9e6a283e409aecb7af20c2e9939ce378f0784589ca11d8322b39a",
      "text": "（不过，拉面店的每次都能轻而易举地制止本大爷和小不点的决斗，是个不可小觑的家伙……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ed89f848d8522b0f78237b53258207b3e63c3891ef7e0fb5ebeb3493c3c25e4",
      "text": "（连这种家伙都摆出这么认真的表情去战斗的世界……那就是偶像吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
      "text": "……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d3e855a3aad1c0b6d064a8feec17338215262485691b04f15e2be0f3840a135",
      "text": "涟？\n怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0359939df72cb6ea9b026135974e4fd5ffa04337b2223015d8cfcbca993a4785",
      "text": "（小不点和拉面店的，\n都打算在本大爷不知道的世界里战斗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40029bc6e475926f860854a92768ab4818b8ddb9e447346dad1a83624759c383",
      "text": "（这边明明胜负都还没分出来……\n切，真让人火大！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922d4e6a5773d97552e8c6e96a8141e6f31641c258a8d623b94b60977ed98945",
      "text": "（……啊？不过等等。\n说起来本大爷那时候也……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1e258ea5c7304ee8f7d3925195ee499be8df5a33687bb4d823d3afde7b4fed2",
      "text": "我觉得你的话，绝对能成为偶像！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df06df7798e263c013a0dcc59099968dbfb9d1a3ff4533897c526fb8e693b469",
      "text": "（什……这家伙在说什么胡话呢！？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ff4bec90c8ec21b281ee7bb1aff28327d4d9b436ac4e28100558c9a48466ed8",
      "text": "……在你们进去的大楼里，\n有个奇怪的家伙也对本大爷说过“能成为偶像”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_013the_02_1_1_013_02:1_1_013_02_i:cmd-000138:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faa1a9e14572304582f8c0d323670d160a6493fe0d21fc6e682e7a66c620a23a",
      "text": "也就是说，本大爷也能在那个偶像的世界里战斗……\n是因为看出来本大爷有这么强吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
